            "review_title": "Review at Mr Lee Korean Food & Drink",
            "review_text": "Janja B\n4 contributions\n0\nUnexpected Gem in Da Nang\nMay 2026 • Couples\nLoved this place! We randomly stopped by after the beach and were so glad we did. We tried the kimbap, ramen, and hotteok with ice cream — everything was absolutely delicious. The atmosphere was relaxed, the staff were incredibly friendly, and the whole experience felt really welcoming. Definitely worth a visit if you’re looking for great Korean food in Da Nang!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 10, 2026\nPhilippe R\nThank you so much for this awesome review 😊 Stopping by after the beach for kimbap, ramyeon, and hotteok with ice cream sounds like a pretty perfect combo. Really happy the relaxed atmosphere and friendly service made the whole experience feel welcoming too.\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
