            "review_text": "Trúc Anh N\n2 contributions\n0\nA good cottage in the top.\nMay 2026 • Solo\nThere was a great experience at Mr. Lee, the beautiful Korean restaurant right in the neighborhood of An Than, the Kim Bap and the roast chicken were delicious, the drinks here were also delicious, the staff was extremely friendly, you should come.\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 6, 2026\nPhilippe R\n(English below) Cảm ơn bạn rất nhiều vì review siêu dễ thương 😊 Rất vui khi bạn thích kimbap, gà rán và cả đồ uống nữa. Một bữa ăn ngon trong không gian nhỏ xinh và thoải mái đúng là điều tụi mình luôn muốn mang lại mỗi ngày.\n\nThank you so much for the lovely review 😊 We’re really happy you enjoyed the kimbap, fried chicken, and drinks too. Creating cozy everyday meals in a relaxed little space is exactly what we aim for.\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
