            "review_text": "Navigate57514562825\n1 contribution\n0\nHidden Gem\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe almost walked past this place but decided to stop - and it turned out to be one of our favorite meals in Da Nang.\nThe kimbap was fresh and simple, the fried chicken was crispy and full of flavor, and everything felt very authentic.\nIt’s not too fancy, just really good Korean street food in a clean and comfortable setting. Definitely a hidden gem near My An.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe hotteok is to die for.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 4, 2026\nPhilippe R\nThank you so much for this amazing review 😊 Really happy you decided to stop by and that it became one of your favorite meals in Da Nang. The fried chicken and kimbap look like they hit the spot, and we love that you enjoyed the simple and comfortable atmosphere too.\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
